{"unit_id":"5d7f9e163261a47f4d7c","title":"附件4.","kind":"attachment","blocks":[{"page":14,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p14-b21","raw_text":"附件4. \n","start_char":0,"end_char":6,"bbox":[36.0,680.7996826171875,88.17359924316406,698.4674072265625]},{"page":14,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p14-b22","raw_text":"含benzbromarone成分藥品之中文仿單修訂內容  \n","start_char":0,"end_char":30,"bbox":[36.0,718.2360229492188,380.0500183105469,734.1959838867188]},{"page":15,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p15-b1","raw_text":"一、 「禁忌症」欄位統一修訂為：  \n","start_char":0,"end_char":19,"bbox":[36.0,46.136024475097656,300.010009765625,62.09602355957031]},{"page":15,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p15-b2","raw_text":"(一) 對本藥過敏者。  \n","start_char":0,"end_char":14,"bbox":[36.0,102.5560073852539,203.989990234375,118.51600646972656]},{"page":15,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p15-b3","raw_text":"(二) 嚴重肝功能不良。  \n","start_char":0,"end_char":15,"bbox":[36.0,159.07601928710938,220.0699920654297,175.03602600097656]},{"page":15,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p15-b4","raw_text":"(三) 嚴重腎功能不良。  \n","start_char":0,"end_char":15,"bbox":[36.0,215.47604370117188,220.0699920654297,231.43605041503906]},{"page":15,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p15-b5","raw_text":"(四) 尿酸性腎臟結石。  \n","start_char":0,"end_char":15,"bbox":[36.0,272.0260314941406,220.0699920654297,287.98602294921875]},{"page":15,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p15-b6","raw_text":"(五) 懷孕及可能懷孕的婦女。  \n","start_char":0,"end_char":18,"bbox":[36.0,328.426025390625,268.07000732421875,344.3860168457031]},{"page":15,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p15-b7","raw_text":"二、 於「警語及注意事項」欄位加刊:  \n","start_char":0,"end_char":21,"bbox":[36.0,384.8260192871094,324.010009765625,400.7860107421875]},{"page":15,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p15-b8","raw_text":"在使用本藥前須檢查肝功能，以確認有無肝臟疾病。並應告知病人使用本藥\n","start_char":0,"end_char":34,"bbox":[36.0,420.8260192871094,559.2326049804688,436.7860107421875]},{"page":15,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p15-b9","raw_text":"可能有肝臟疾病的副作用，如出現食慾不振、噁心嘔吐、疲倦虛弱、腹痛、\n","start_char":0,"end_char":34,"bbox":[36.0,456.84600830078125,563.1808471679688,472.8059997558594]},{"page":15,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p15-b10","raw_text":"下痢、發燒、深色尿液、結膜變黃等症狀，應停藥並立即就醫。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":30,"bbox":[36.0,491.40960693359375,487.9499816894531,509.07733154296875]},{"page":15,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p15-b11","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[36.0,528.129638671875,39.9900016784668,545.79736328125]}],"source_quality":[]}